{"book":"II Chronicles","chapter":3,"entries":[{"id":11230,"title":"II Chronicles 3:1","segments":["¶Then Solomon began to build the house of the LORD at Jerusalem in mount Moriah, where [the LORD] appeared unto David his father, in the place that David had prepared in the threshingfloor of Ornan the Jebusite. {where...: or, which was seen of David his father} {Ornan: also called, Araunah}"],"ref":"II Chronicles 3:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶Then Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":" began","strong":"H2490"},{"text":" to build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" the house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" at Jerusalem","strong":"H3389"},{"text":" in mount","strong":"H2022"},{"text":" Moriah","strong":"H4179"},{"text":", where [the LORD] appeared","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" unto David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" his father","strong":"H1"},{"text":", in the place","strong":"H4725"},{"text":" that David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" had prepared","strong":"H3559"},{"text":" in the threshingfloor","strong":"H1637"},{"text":" of Ornan","strong":"H771"},{"text":" the Jebusite","strong":"H2983"},{"text":". {where...: or, which was seen of David his father} {Ornan: also called, Araunah}"}]},{"id":11231,"title":"II Chronicles 3:2","segments":["And he began to build in the second [day] of the second month, in the fourth year of his reign."],"ref":"II Chronicles 3:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And he began","strong":"H2490"},{"text":" to build","strong":"H1129"},{"text":" in the second","strong":"H8145"},{"text":" [day] of the second","strong":"H8145"},{"text":" month","strong":"H2320"},{"text":", in the fourth","strong":"H702"},{"text":" year","strong":"H8141"},{"text":" of his reign","strong":"H4438"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":11232,"title":"II Chronicles 3:3","segments":["Now these [are the things wherein] Solomon was instructed for the building of the house of God. The length by cubits after the first measure [was] threescore cubits, and the br